# Environment variables for kolscanhispano.fun.
#
# Real values live only in .env.local, which is gitignored and never echoed,
# logged, or pasted on a command line. This file documents the shape only.
#
# Nothing is required yet: this scaffold touches no database, no network
# service, and no API key. Variables are added here by the tasks that
# introduce them (starting with DATABASE_URL / TEST_DATABASE_URL).
